		category = "city",
		title = "The Claws",
		text = "The Claws are the Head's enforcers. They come from C Corp, the Claw, one of the bodies the Head rules through, along with the Eye that watches. When someone breaks a Taboo of the City, the Claws carry out the sentence. There is no trial and no appeal.\n\nMost people never see one. The people who do describe the same few things: a long coat, no hurry, and a street that is very quiet afterward.\n\nWhen a violation is serious enough, the Head sends an Arbiter instead, an elite agent far beyond any Fixer. Backstreets people don't say the word aloud if they can help it.",
