		category = "city",
		title = "The Taboos of the City",
		text = "The Head sets the Taboos, and they bind everyone: Backstreets families, Fixers, the Fingers and the Wings themselves. A Wing can set its own Nest Taboos too, but a City Taboo is different. Breaking one is a death sentence.\n\nThe ones everybody knows: never bring the dead back, body and mind. Never build a machine that thinks like a person. During the Night in the Backstreets, never record anything, and never break into someone else's home.\n\nA Wing that breaks a Taboo loses its place in the City. A person who breaks one loses more than that.",
