		text = "Past the Nests and past the Backstreets, the City runs out. What's left is the Outskirts: dead fields, old factories, human villages that trade with no one, and monsters.\n\nOutskirts monsters aren't Abnormalities and they aren't Distortions. They are simply things that live out there, and they hate people. Travelers also tell of Gnomes and Giants, beings that think and speak and are not human at all.\n\nWorkshops pay very well for Outskirts salvage. Most of the people who go out to get it ask to be paid in advance.",
