		category = "districts",
		title = "Trash Crabs",
		text = "Trash Crabs are monsters of the Great Lake, the huge patchwork lake at the City's south end where District 21 floats. They aren't Abnormalities or Distortions. They're crabs that grew very large on whatever the City throws away.\n\nU Corp's Singularity, the resonance tuning fork, fuses two unlike things into one as if they'd always been together. Somebody used it to fuse guns into Trash Crabs. Now some of them shoot back.\n\nFishing crews haul them up in nets every season, and lose people to them every season.",
