		title = "What the Smoke War Left",
		text = "The Smoke War ended long ago. Its weapons didn't all get the news. Old G Corp of District 7 fought on the front lines with what it called decisive weapons, and veterans still whisper the rumored names: the Maggot Prince, the Moth Princess, the Lord of Flies.\n\nMost were destroyed. Some were buried. Every few years a rubble lot in District 7 turns up a dark shell the size of a car, still warm and faintly ticking, and the street empties until someone brave or desperate deals with it.\n\nThen there's the Roach Emperor, which every veteran swears is only a story. They swear it a little too quickly.",
