		title = "Feather Raids",
		text = "Feathers are people who work for a Wing. Most are clerks and technicians. Some are retrieval teams in clean white armor, and when a Wing loses something to the Backstreets, a patent, a prototype, a runaway employee, those are the Feathers it sends.\n\nA retrieval team doesn't knock and doesn't apologize. A Wing's Singularity is worth more to it than any street, and the Head itself punishes anyone who copies a patent.\n\nThe Backstreets rule is simple. If a neighbor asks you to hold a box for them, say no.",
