		text = "Inside Lobotomy Corporation, a breach is when a contained Abnormality gets out of its unit. L Corp has whole teams for that. Outside the walls, nobody does.\n\nIt didn't happen often. When it did, something came up through a supply tunnel or a maintenance shaft into the Backstreets of District 12, and the sirens on the green tower howled over streets that had no idea what to do. The suppression teams came eventually. Eventually is a long time.\n\nL Corp never admitted any of it. It did quietly pay for a lot of new doors.",
